    "Cancel" : {

    },
    "Centre on Hive" : {

    },
    "Changes apply from now on. Over 200 simulated colonies, about 92% see their first spring on Forgiving, 89% on Natural and 64% on Harsh; by the second spring it is 60%, 66% and 14%. Forgiving is not safer over two years: well-fed colonies swarm more, and every swarm stakes the colony on a virgin queen's mating flight." : {

    },
