    "Firsts belong to this colony. A new colony earns its own." : {

    },
    "Five modelling errors were found by tracing single colonies through their deaths rather than by reading the average — comb being drawn out of the winter larder, a second swarm cast on the day a new queen mated, and three queen bugs before those. Each of them made the game easier or harder for a reason that had nothing to do with design." : {

