    "The almanac fills as the year goes by: the first flow, the first swarm cell, what came to the nest." : {

    },
    "The bees will narrow the entrance with propolis before winter unless you say otherwise. Sealed, it keeps mice out and warmth in, and the damp with it. Open, the cluster breathes and anything small can walk in." : {

